cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it using the preferred-citation information.
type: dataset
license: BSD-3-Clause
title: Celestial Data
abstract: Celestial datasets for the J2000 reference, derived from d3-celestial
  and processed with R and sf. GeoJSON and GeoPackage files encode celestial
  coordinates as geographic geometries for GIS compatibility; CSV files provide
  complementary names and attributes. The coordinates are not Earth locations.

